  description: A pair of disposable gloves documented as a potential scene item.
  foundLocation: Concealed within the scene, separate from ordinary discarded items.
  observedCondition: Reddish staining was visible on the outer surface. The gloves
    were preserved so the exterior could be sampled before the interior was handled.
  investigativeContext: Material on the outside and handling traces on the inside
    may address different questions. Any association should be evaluated with other
    evidence and does not establish responsibility by itself.
  progressiveFindings:
